  m_Text: 'This shows you how the <color=#0FF>Terrain</color> and <color=#0FF>Universe</color>
    features can be combined to render a planet with the same radius as Earth.



    Q/E
    = Roll     WASD/Arrows/Pinch = Move     Click/Touch + Drag = Look     Wheel =
    Change Speed'
